 (text "BMS link: opto-isolated UART to the JBD smart BMS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "1b216b86-a4ad-57c2-bda8-b860e9c17cca"))
(text "JBD UART port (Overkill/JBD manual D.1.2): 1 VDD, 2 TX, 3 RX, 4 GND; on the BMS it is a 4-pin JST-PA 2.0." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "97351f4e-2bb9-5353-9901-81ffc072ef4a"))
(text "An off-board adapter lead maps it to J201 (JST-XH 4). The BMS side switches B-, so its GND must never" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "fead8bed-2731-54c6-90bb-ea31d8369f27"))
(text "meet board GND (esphome-jbd-bms warning; rev A review P-M1): two PC817s are the only link." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "280db494-e42e-5f73-bbbc-f2b980b01b2f"))
(text "BMS side powered from the port VDD (3.3-5 V expected; measure before plugging). 9600 baud." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "a5aba5a4-209b-5faf-ba1b-5cb5e3bcc2e2"))
(text "Pico TX low -> U202 LED on -> BMS RX low. BMS TX low -> U201 LED on -> Pico RX low (both non-inverting)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "70db8db9-8384-5701-98ef-1e65f7cd2906"))
(text "Keep 2 mm between the BMS_* copper and everything else; no pour crosses the U201/U202 gap." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b3f1227e-7b21-5068-9265-5524c3dadf57"))
